statement's other sentences (the surplus or shortage, the repayment plan)
are decisionText and planText in the servicing app's ops.ts, which is not
ported: it carries the stateful operations layer (the event store, the timer
engine, the interest and disbursement modules) around them.

To take a change from the servicing app, copy the file again and rewrite the
same three imports.
